{"id":"unruhig","lemma":"unruhig","pos":"adj","rank":4907,"glosses":["noisy","anxious, restless"],"ipa":"/ˈʊnʁuːɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8d/De-unruhig.ogg/De-unruhig.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"unruhiger","superlative":"am unruhigsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Alle warten unruhig, was wohl passieren wird.","en":"Everyone's waiting nervously to see what'll happen.","words":[{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"to wait"},null,{"g":"what"},{"g":"possibly, probably"},{"g":"to happen"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"}]},{"text":"Sie war unruhig, weil sie nichts zu tun hatte.","en":"She was restless because she did not have anything to do.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"because, given that"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Tom ist unruhig.","en":"Tom is skittish.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/73002","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Die Stadt ist nicht mehr so unruhig, wie sie war.","en":"This city is not so busy as it used to be.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"city"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"so"},null,{"g":"how"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Tom sieht sehr unruhig aus.","en":"Tom looks very uneasy.","words":[null,{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"very"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]}]}